GIMP Palette
Name: Pupu
Columns: 4
#
# Pupu v1 palette. Every frame uses only these 16 slots; each slot has a fixed job.
# Slot 0 is transparent: paint it with a fully transparent pixel, never with this colour.
# Slots 8-10 are the wool; the firmware blends them toward grey as the mood drops.
  0   0   0	00 clear (transparent)
 43  33  24	01 outline
 30  27  26	02 face and hooves
 74  68  63	03 face highlight
255 255 255	04 eye white
242 155 160	05 blush
200 155  98	06 horn
142 106  63	07 horn shadow
255 248 231	08 wool light
241 224 190	09 wool mid
214 189 147	10 wool shadow
247 241 227	11 eggshell
216 205 182	12 eggshell shade
 47  74 138	13 passport ink
224  58  58	14 spare
 47 168  79	15 spare
